Mortgage Payment Feature
Summary
Add a full payment flow for mortgage loans:

Summary cards (outstanding, penalty, paid, months overdue)
"Record Payment" button → modal dialog
Backend API route POST /:id/payment
New MortgageCollection + MortgageCollectionItem Prisma models
Proposed Changes
Schema (prisma/schema.prisma)
Add principalPaid Decimal @default(0.00) to MortgageLoan
Add collections MortgageCollection[] to MortgageLoan
Add mortgageCollections MortgageCollection[] to Client and User
Add collectionItems MortgageCollectionItem[] to MortgageInstalment
New MortgageCollection model
New MortgageCollectionItem model
Backend API (routes/mortgage-loans/index.js)
POST /api/mortgage-loans/:id/payment

Payment priority logic:

Oldest unpaid instalment first (monthNumber ASC)
For each instalment: pay penalty first, then due amount
If money left after all instalments → reduce principalPaid on loan
Create MortgageCollection + MortgageCollectionItem records in one transaction
Frontend Service (services/mortgageLoanApi.ts)
Add recordPayment service method
Add useRecordMortgagePaymentMutation hook
Frontend UI (app/(dashboard)/mortgage-loans/[id]/page.tsx)
Summary cards above table (total remaining, penalty, paid, overdue months)
"Record Payment" button
Payment dialog with amount + notes fields